{"seq":3,"slug":"inhouse-bank-payment-factory","title":"内部银行与收付款工厂","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-treasury-cash-pooling/cash-pool-structure/inhouse-bank-payment-factory","wordCount":2038,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"内部银行与收付款工厂\">内部银行与收付款工厂</h1><p>资金归集做到一定程度，集团会发现真正的瓶颈不在资金本身，而在<strong>收付与账务的组织方式</strong>：几十个主体各自开户、各自与银行签约、各自维护付款授权、各自向供应商付款，集团的资金优势被这些分散动作稀释掉。解法是把这些动作集中到一个内部实体上——内部银行（in-house bank）及其收付款执行层，即收付款工厂（payment factory）。它和 <a href=\"../payment-reconciliation-hub-global/\">074 支付对账中台</a>的区别在于：对账中台处理的是交易侧的对账，收付款工厂处理的是集团自有资金在银行侧的集中执行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>内部银行是集团内部的一个虚拟或实体机构，成员企业不再直接与外部银行发生资金往来，而是与内部银行发生往来；内部银行再作为一个统一面孔与外部银行打交道。这样做的直接收益是：外部银行关系从 N 个主体 × M 家银行收敛为 1 个主体 × M 家银行，付款指令、余额、费用、对账全部集中。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[成员企业 A] --&gt;|内部账户 记账| IB[内部银行 In-House Bank]&#10;    B[成员企业 B] --&gt;|内部账户 记账| IB&#10;    C[成员企业 C] --&gt;|内部账户 记账| IB&#10;    IB --&gt;|统一对外| BK1[合作银行 1]&#10;    IB --&gt;|统一对外| BK2[合作银行 2]&#10;    IB --&gt; PF[收付款工厂]&#10;    PF --&gt; P1[批量付款 文件生成]&#10;    PF --&gt; P2[支付状态跟踪]&#10;    PF --&gt; P3[异常退回处理]\">graph TD\n    A[成员企业 A] --&gt;|内部账户 记账| IB[内部银行 In-House Bank]\n    B[成员企业 B] --&gt;|内部账户 记账| IB\n    C[成员企业 C] --&gt;|内部账户 记账| IB\n    IB --&gt;|统一对外| BK1[合作银行 1]\n    IB --&gt;|统一对外| BK2[合作银行 2]\n    IB --&gt; PF[收付款工厂]\n    PF --&gt; P1[批量付款 文件生成]\n    PF --&gt; P2[支付状态跟踪]\n    PF --&gt; P3[异常退回处理]</pre><p>内部银行有两种形态。<strong>虚拟内部银行</strong>只在集团账套里为成员开立内部账户，不做真实的实体，成员仍以自身名义对外收付但通过内部账户与内部银行轧差。<strong>实体内部银行</strong>是一个真实法人（常设在税制与监管友好的法域），成员在其处开立真实账户，资金真实归集。前者设立成本低但无法真正集中对外收付；后者才能实现收付款工厂的完整价值，代价是引入一个新的受监管实体。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>形态</th>\n<th>成员对外关系</th>\n<th>资金是否集中</th>\n<th>设立成本</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>虚拟内部银行</td>\n<td>成员自身名义</td>\n<td>否（仅轧差）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>内部计息、净额结算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实体内部银行</td>\n<td>内部银行名义</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>收付款集中、资金归集</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收付款工厂</td>\n<td>内部银行代付</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>中（依附内部银行）</td>\n<td>批量支付、统一付款通道</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"收付款工厂的运转机制\">收付款工厂的运转机制</h2><p>收付款工厂的目标是让成员企业&quot;看不见银行&quot;，只提交付款请求，由工厂统一执行。核心是三个能力：指令聚合、执行编排、状态回传。</p>\n<h3 id=\"净额结算-把多笔变一笔\">净额结算：把多笔变一笔</h3><p>付款工厂最先实现的通常是成员之间的<strong>内部净额结算</strong>。A 欠 B 100 万、B 欠 A 60 万，净额后只需 A 付 B 40 万。多边净额把这一逻辑扩展到 N 个主体：对每个主体计算其在结算周期内的净头寸，只有净头寸非零的主体参与实际支付，且每个主体最多付一笔、收一笔。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH gross AS (&#10;  SELECT from_entity, to_entity, settle_ccy, SUM(amount) AS amt&#10;  FROM intercompany_payable&#10;  WHERE settle_cycle = &#39;2026-09&#39;&#10;  GROUP BY from_entity, to_entity, settle_ccy&#10;),&#10;net AS (&#10;  SELECT entity, settle_ccy,&#10;         SUM(net_amount) AS net_amount&#10;  FROM (&#10;    SELECT from_entity AS entity, settle_ccy,  -amt AS net_amount FROM gross&#10;    UNION ALL&#10;    SELECT to_entity   AS entity, settle_ccy,   amt AS net_amount FROM gross&#10;  ) t&#10;  GROUP BY entity, settle_ccy&#10;)&#10;SELECT entity, settle_ccy, net_amount&#10;FROM net&#10;WHERE ABS(net_amount) &gt;= 0.01&#10;ORDER BY settle_ccy, net_amount DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gross </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> from_entity, to_entity, settle_ccy, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> intercompany_payable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> settle_cycle </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-09'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> from_entity, to_entity, settle_ccy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">net </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entity, settle_ccy,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(net_amount) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> net_amount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> from_entity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entity, settle_ccy,  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">amt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> net_amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gross</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    UNION ALL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> to_entity   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entity, settle_ccy,   amt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> net_amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gross</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ) t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entity, settle_ccy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entity, settle_ccy, net_amount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> net</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ABS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(net_amount) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">01</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> settle_ccy, net_amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>净额结算的效果是数量级的：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个主体两两之间最多有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N(N-1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 笔应付，净额后最多剩 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 笔。这一削减不仅省手续费，更省的是每笔支付背后的合规审查与状态跟踪成本。</p>\n<h3 id=\"支付指令的聚合与格式化\">支付指令的聚合与格式化</h3><p>工厂从成员接收付款请求后，要聚合成银行能接受的批量文件。这里的技术标准是 ISO 20022——支付发起用 CustomerCreditTransferInitiation（pain.001），银行间客户贷记转账用 FIToFICustomerCreditTransfer（pacs.008），对账单用 BankToCustomerStatement（camt.053）。这些报文标识符是支付工厂与银行对接时的通用语言，选择支持哪些报文直接决定了工厂能对接多少家银行。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;messageType&quot;: &quot;pain.001.001.09&quot;,&#10;  &quot;groupHeader&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;msgId&quot;: &quot;PF-20260901-0001&quot;,&#10;    &quot;creationDateTime&quot;: &quot;2026-09-01T14:00:00+08:00&quot;,&#10;    &quot;numberOfTransactions&quot;: 3,&#10;    &quot;controlSum&quot;: 1284500.0,&#10;    &quot;initiatingParty&quot;: { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Group In-House Bank&quot; }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;paymentInfo&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;paymentMethod&quot;: &quot;TRF&quot;,&#10;    &quot;requestedExecutionDate&quot;: &quot;2026-09-02&quot;,&#10;    &quot;debtor&quot;: { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Group In-House Bank&quot;, &quot;account&quot;: &quot;NL91XXXX&quot; },&#10;    &quot;creditTransfers&quot;: [&#10;      {&#10;        &quot;endToEndId&quot;: &quot;INV-88213&quot;,&#10;        &quot;amount&quot;: 500000.0,&#10;        &quot;currency&quot;: &quot;EUR&quot;,&#10;        &quot;creditor&quot;: { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Supplier Alpha&quot;, &quot;account&quot;: &quot;DE89XXXX&quot; }&#10;      },&#10;      {&#10;        &quot;endToEndId&quot;: &quot;INV-88214&quot;,&#10;        &quot;amount&quot;: 634500.0,&#10;        &quot;currency&quot;: &quot;EUR&quot;,&#10;        &quot;creditor&quot;: { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Supplier Beta&quot;, &quot;account&quot;: &quot;FR76XXXX&quot; }&#10;      },&#10;      {&#10;        &quot;endToEndId&quot;: &quot;INV-88215&quot;,&#10;        &quot;amount&quot;: 150000.0,&#10;        &quot;currency&quot;: &quot;EUR&quot;,&#10;        &quot;creditor&quot;: { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Supplier Gamma&quot;, &quot;account&quot;: &quot;ES91XXXX&quot; }&#10;      }&#10;    ]&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"messageType\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pain.001.001.09\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"groupHeader\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"msgId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PF-20260901-0001\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"creationDateTime\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-01T14:00:00+08:00\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"numberOfTransactions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark